  "ruleText": "Env-A 3002.05 \"Area source\" for the purposes of Env-A 3000 through Env-A 3200 means \"area source\" as defined in RSA 125-J:1,III, namely \"stationary or non-road sources of emissions which are too small or too numerous to be individually included in a stationary source emissions inventory maintained by the division.\"\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
